{"data": [{"author_id": "17217640", "created_at": "2026-10-27T04:27:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114936928671760766"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Watch live coverage as SpaceX launches a Falcon 9 rocket from Calif...", "display_url": "youtube.com/watch?v=Wr5MiA…", "end": 278, "expanded_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Wr5MiAFVyfo", "images": [{"height": 720, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114936931842662400/YFWtg_kp?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1280}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114936931842662400/YFWtg_kp?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 255, "status": 200, "title": "SpaceX Falcon 9 rocket launches 27 Starlink satellites from California", "unwound_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Wr5MiAFVyfo", "url": "https://t.co/Jz9aPjZuHa"}]}, "id": "2114936928671760766", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 8978, "like_count": 23, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "SpaceX aims to launch a Falcon 9 rocket shortly after midnight from Vandenberg Space Force Base. Liftoff of the Starlink 15-16 mission is scheduled for 12:25 a.m. PDT (3:25 a.m. EDT / 0825 UTC). Our live coverage begins 30 minutes before liftoff.\n\nWatch: https://t.co/Jz9aPjZuHa", "url": "https://x.com/SpaceflightNow/status/2114936928671760766"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-27T02:34:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114908482235421144"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/RichardMCNgo/s…", "end": 230, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/RichardMCNgo/status/2114749958025052666", "start": 207, "url": "https://t.co/nsVO7DQTJI"}]}, "id": "2114908482235421144", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 2447, "like_count": 38, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114749958025052666", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "why would you need motivated reasoning?\n\ndeveloping weapons is an honorable trade and nothing to be ashamed of.\n\ni'd be quite proud if i were the designer of hunter-killer-murder-drone-7.3b-final-revised-v9 https://t.co/nsVO7DQTJI", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2114908482235421144"}, {"author_id": "17217640", "created_at": "2026-10-27T00:59:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114884650136952997"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Plans for the next missions in NASA's Artemis moon landing program ...", "display_url": "youtu.be/TkJFZ0epQp8?is…", "end": 262, "expanded_url": "https://youtu.be/TkJFZ0epQp8?is=PnKYJ8ncrzfZ_b8c", "images": [{"height": 720, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114884655014875136/ZH6VVsw3?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1280}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114884655014875136/ZH6VVsw3?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 239, "status": 200, "title": "Artemis Debrief: Interview with NASA's Amit Kshatriya", "unwound_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?is=PnKYJ8ncrzfZ_b8c&v=TkJFZ0epQp8&feature=youtu.be", "url": "https://t.co/Nxe1MdrvH0"}]}, "id": "2114884650136952997", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 9, "impression_count": 11557, "like_count": 33, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 12}, "text": "NASA’s two-hour news conference on the state of the Artemis Program included updates on SLS/Orion, the commercial landers, and spacesuits. To learn even more, we sat down with the agency’s associate administrator, Amit Kshatriya. \n\nWatch: https://t.co/Nxe1MdrvH0", "url": "https://x.com/SpaceflightNow/status/2114884650136952997"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-27T00:36:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114878865927741619"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/sfmcguire79/st…", "end": 170, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/sfmcguire79/status/2114825305382695285", "start": 147, "url": "https://t.co/31DlSvnMeQ"}]}, "id": "2114878865927741619", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 15, "impression_count": 6445, "like_count": 301, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 24}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114825305382695285", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This is an endemic issue— liberal organizations and people are described in nonpartisan terms, while conservatives are assigned ideological labels https://t.co/31DlSvnMeQ", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2114878865927741619"}, {"author_id": "46648807", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:25:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114830689304543284"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "The NBSB was established in 1979 at NIST in Gaithersburg, MD with a pilot project archiving human liver samples associated with collections through the Environmental Protection Agency (EPA). New collaborations and banking projects were established including the National Oceanic and Atmospheric Admin", "display_url": "nist.gov/programs-proje…", "end": 243, "expanded_url": "https://www.nist.gov/programs-projects/nist-biorepository", "images": [{"height": 416, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114830733114040322/Z7Y4jsF9?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 625}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114830733114040322/Z7Y4jsF9?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 220, "status": 200, "title": "The NIST Biorepository", "unwound_url": "https://www.nist.gov/programs-projects/nist-biorepository", "url": "https://t.co/TycWTIDUKk"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/YxLumGmEMB", "end": 267, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/NIST/status/2114830689304543284/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114830685827379200", "start": 244, "url": "https://t.co/YxLumGmEMB"}]}, "id": "2114830689304543284", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1376, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "What looks like a witch’s cauldron is actually an ultracold freezer that holds marine animal tissue samples. This is part of the NIST Biorepository at the Hollings Marine Lab in Charleston, South Carolina. \n\nLearn more: https://t.co/TycWTIDUKk https://t.co/YxLumGmEMB", "url": "https://x.com/NIST/status/2114830689304543284"}, {"author_id": "6374602", "created_at": "2026-10-26T20:00:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114809371322687933"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 53, "id": "12701122", "start": 40, "username": "astrosociety"}]}, "id": "2114809371322687933", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 11, "impression_count": 17603, "like_count": 231, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 17}, "text": "Blue Origin's John Couluris says at the @astrosociety Von Braun Symposium today that the company is planning to activate the rebuilt LC-36A in early to mid December with a New Glenn return to flight still possible before year's end.", "url": "https://x.com/jeff_foust/status/2114809371322687933"}, {"author_id": "17217640", "created_at": "2026-10-26T19:51:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114807132977807552"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 125, "id": "28184452", "start": 111, "username": "NASA_Marshall"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/edok7cluHC", "end": 188, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SpaceflightNow/status/2114807132977807552/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114807121577463809", "start": 165, "url": "https://t.co/edok7cluHC"}]}, "id": "2114807132977807552", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 26, "impression_count": 15219, "like_count": 99, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 15}, "text": "The next panel focuses on Artemis 3 and beyond hosted by Steve Creech, Human Landing System program manager at @NASA_Marshall. Follow this thread for updates.\n\n🧵1/n https://t.co/edok7cluHC", "url": "https://x.com/SpaceflightNow/status/2114807132977807552"}, {"author_id": "17217640", "created_at": "2026-10-26T19:40:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114804342637334811"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 53, "id": "12701122", "start": 40, "username": "astrosociety"}, {"end": 83, "id": "1336976892", "start": 75, "username": "LMSpace"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/EomqdTzqLc", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SpaceflightNow/status/2114804342637334811/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114804040764735489", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/EomqdTzqLc"}]}, "id": "2114804342637334811", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 7537, "like_count": 40, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 11}, "text": "Discussing the Artemis 2 mission at the @astrosociety von Braun Symposium, @LMSpace's Kirk Shireman says regarding data that he'd love to have from the mission would be to retrieve the European Service Module to be able to examine the pressure regulator that had a leak. He also https://t.co/EomqdTzqLc", "url": "https://x.com/SpaceflightNow/status/2114804342637334811"}, {"author_id": "11348282", "created_at": "2026-10-26T19:29:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114801524358406570"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 13, "id": "29472803", "start": 4, "username": "NASAWebb"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/CT6zPZbA1u", "end": 214, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/NASA/status/2114801524358406570/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114801519371436033", "start": 191, "url": "https://t.co/CT6zPZbA1u"}]}, "id": "2114801524358406570", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 244, "impression_count": 1145820, "like_count": 5599, "quote_count": 42, "reply_count": 202, "retweet_count": 757}, "text": "The @NASAWebb telescope recently spotted stars brewing in this cosmic cauldron. This region of toil and trouble, named N159, is 161,000 light-years from Earth, in the Large Magellanic Cloud. https://t.co/CT6zPZbA1u", "url": "https://x.com/NASA/status/2114801524358406570"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-26T18:59:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114794151606620584"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/GiveDirectly/s…", "end": 52, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/GiveDirectly/status/2114694007334801673", "start": 29, "url": "https://t.co/ZIs0ePHdkN"}]}, "id": "2114794151606620584", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 63, "impression_count": 11395, "like_count": 190, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 10}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114694007334801673", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "this is a truly fantastic ad https://t.co/ZIs0ePHdkN", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2114794151606620584"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-26T18:48:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114791285840384354"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/Saul_Sadka/sta…", "end": 230, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/Saul_Sadka/status/2114428125765333041", "start": 207, "url": "https://t.co/kMWpIy1bmR"}]}, "id": "2114791285840384354", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 9, "impression_count": 5662, "like_count": 72, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 4}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114428125765333041", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "you just know the first draft of this ad ended not \"mike rogers is for *ahem* they/them, abdul el sayed is for you\" but rather \"mike rogers is for jews, abdul el sayed is for you\"\n\nthat was totally draft #1 https://t.co/kMWpIy1bmR", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2114791285840384354"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-26T18:43:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114789984385511788"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/ecurrnomics/st…", "end": 244, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/ecurrnomics/status/2114646335194530079", "start": 221, "url": "https://t.co/14C79J9oGB"}]}, "id": "2114789984385511788", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 10, "impression_count": 6322, "like_count": 109, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114646335194530079", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Online right: \"mainstream publications can never show these forbidden facts\"\n\nThe Economist: shows the forbidden facts\n\nOnline right: \"BUT YOU DIDN'T DESIGN IT TO BE THE ABSOLUTE MOST RACIST GRAPH WE COULD IMAGINE!?!?!?\" https://t.co/14C79J9oGB", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2114789984385511788"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-26T18:27:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114786069946544400"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/highbrow_nobro…", "end": 38, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/highbrow_nobrow/status/2114190465528389989", "start": 15, "url": "https://t.co/qotnD2MUvR"}]}, "id": "2114786069946544400", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 9, "impression_count": 8002, "like_count": 229, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 12}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114190465528389989", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "brb saving god https://t.co/qotnD2MUvR", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2114786069946544400"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-26T18:22:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114784640481591620"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/lymanstoneky/s…", "end": 126, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/lymanstoneky/status/2114780407812305358", "start": 103, "url": "https://t.co/zHDueMklu8"}]}, "id": "2114784640481591620", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 1243, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114780407812305358", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "one exciting part of this project was make sure i can spell \"Homonadensian\" correctly on the first try https://t.co/zHDueMklu8", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2114784640481591620"}, {"author_id": "17217640", "created_at": "2026-10-26T18:17:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114783594388332677"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 36, "id": "26014305", "start": 23, "username": "UAHuntsville"}, {"end": 116, "id": "12701122", "start": 103, "username": "astrosociety"}, {"end": 158, "id": "1700538650", "start": 142, "username": "w_robinsonsmith"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/flaPhObzhg", "end": 263, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SpaceflightNow/status/2114783594388332677/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114783589627748352", "start": 240, "url": "https://t.co/flaPhObzhg"}]}, "id": "2114783594388332677", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 6398, "like_count": 36, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "We’re on the ground at @UAHuntsville for the 2026 AAS von Braun Space Exploration Symposium, hosted by @astrosociety. Follow this account and @w_robinsonsmith for updates from the multi-day event in the Rocket City.\n\n📸: Will Robinson-Smith https://t.co/flaPhObzhg", "url": "https://x.com/SpaceflightNow/status/2114783594388332677"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-26T18:06:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114780779272130839"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/lymanstoneky/s…", "end": 146, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/lymanstoneky/status/2114780583704322553", "start": 123, "url": "https://t.co/DyFBlTj18D"}]}, "id": "2114780779272130839", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 2495, "like_count": 19, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114780583704322553", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "it ends up not solving the textual issue\n\nbut i'm prepared to die on this hill:\n\nQuirinius was legate of Syria in 3 BC!!!! https://t.co/DyFBlTj18D", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2114780779272130839"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-26T18:05:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114780407812305358"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/gxwVgPKBox", "end": 177, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2114780407812305358/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114780399058513921", "start": 154, "url": "https://t.co/gxwVgPKBox"}]}, "id": "2114780407812305358", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 96, "impression_count": 19155, "like_count": 217, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 19}, "text": "I wanted to write about the census of Quirinius in Luke 2 so naturally I made a tool to browse all 132 censuses documented in 800 years of Roman history. https://t.co/gxwVgPKBox", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2114780407812305358"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-26T17:52:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114777106999542267"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/bMwPkoozKS", "end": 61, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2114777106999542267/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114777097033949184", "start": 38, "url": "https://t.co/bMwPkoozKS"}]}, "id": "2114777106999542267", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 19, "impression_count": 8111, "like_count": 41, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "you must make your churches beautiful https://t.co/bMwPkoozKS", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2114777106999542267"}, {"author_id": "610659001", "created_at": "2026-10-26T17:39:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114773909388099872"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/RwuuknQXCW", "end": 298, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/MaxCRoser/status/2114773909388099872/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114772969759105024", "start": 275, "url": "https://t.co/RwuuknQXCW"}]}, "id": "2114773909388099872", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 15, "impression_count": 9436, "like_count": 253, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 35}, "text": "The Wikipedia community has built a tool that makes it possible to embed our interactive Our World in Data charts right in any Wikipedia page.\n\nI have always admired Wikipedia and all the people contributing to it. And I'm very happy that our work now can get used this way! https://t.co/RwuuknQXCW", "url": "https://x.com/MaxCRoser/status/2114773909388099872"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-26T16:11:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114751789371150795"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/raybury/status…", "end": 274, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/raybury/status/2114747623802650753", "start": 251, "url": "https://t.co/1IOhNVCVSH"}]}, "id": "2114751789371150795", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2118, "like_count": 25, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114747623802650753", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Correct, he is saying we belong to God, so give yourself to God\n\nYet by that very same statement, he is saying the coin belongs to Caesar, so give the coin to God\n\nIf you think Jesus is defending hoarding money for yourself, my dude, you are mixed up https://t.co/1IOhNVCVSH", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2114751789371150795"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-26T15:48:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114746066213978327"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/mp0GkOf2NF", "end": 217, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2114746066213978327/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114745785430560769", "start": 194, "url": "https://t.co/mp0GkOf2NF"}, {"display_url": "x.com/Doug_Bandow/st…", "end": 241, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/Doug_Bandow/status/2114726792720531756", "start": 218, "url": "https://t.co/wjaVZqfFA4"}]}, "id": "2114746066213978327", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 3273, "like_count": 25, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114726792720531756", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "the rebuke is to the pharisees who are trying to trap him with an anti-Roman take; he rebukes them by inviting them to define \"what is God's\", but it is unambiguous what he thinks is \"Caesar's\" https://t.co/mp0GkOf2NF https://t.co/wjaVZqfFA4", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2114746066213978327"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-26T13:33:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114711995874246810"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/InfoAtJames/st…", "end": 28, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/InfoAtJames/status/2113792737615270114", "start": 5, "url": "https://t.co/oitzhsTyTP"}]}, "id": "2114711995874246810", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2589, "like_count": 34, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113792737615270114", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "💪💪💪💪 https://t.co/oitzhsTyTP", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2114711995874246810"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-26T13:24:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114709666425159734"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/stephmurrayyyy…", "end": 123, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/stephmurrayyyy/status/2114481579305369894", "start": 100, "url": "https://t.co/MCJlq5Vgz0"}]}, "id": "2114709666425159734", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 16, "impression_count": 9088, "like_count": 193, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 28, "retweet_count": 7}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114481579305369894", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "The people who find parenting hardest are people with the most support and money to make it easiest https://t.co/MCJlq5Vgz0", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2114709666425159734"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-26T11:46:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114685095336620190"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/iwomansplainer…", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/iwomansplainer/status/2114337882282312038", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/sMnleTmbuC"}]}, "id": "2114685095336620190", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 33, "impression_count": 19559, "like_count": 490, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 42, "retweet_count": 8}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114337882282312038", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "My rule of thumb is you can usually leave a child with a trusted family member for the number of nights equal to their year of age, and if you have not done so, YOU NEED TO. Occasionally getting a little breathing room is good for you, for your marriage, and for your parenting. https://t.co/sMnleTmbuC", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2114685095336620190"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-26T11:17:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114677915140886808"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/doug_bandow/st…", "end": 95, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/doug_bandow/status/2114666490976706941", "start": 72, "url": "https://t.co/YU6ikSXhhl"}]}, "id": "2114677915140886808", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4275, "like_count": 66, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114666490976706941", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Jesus father famously did order them to turn their money over to Caesar https://t.co/YU6ikSXhhl", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2114677915140886808"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "17217640", "name": "Spaceflight Now", "username": "SpaceflightNow"}, {"id": "626660983", "name": "Lyman Stone 石來民 🦬🦬🦬", "username": "lymanstoneky"}, {"id": "46648807", "name": "National Institute of Standards and Technology", "username": "NIST"}, {"id": "6374602", "name": "Jeff Foust", "username": "jeff_foust"}, {"id": "11348282", "name": "NASA", "username": "NASA"}, {"id": "610659001", "name": "Max Roser", "username": "MaxCRoser"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2114936928671760766", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlx912eh6s33o5zl8myaexcelapp", "oldest_id": "2114677915140886808", "result_count": 25}}
